[2318]="Translating the Journal|42|1517|37|6912|||6868||2284|2338|Find someone who can translate the paladin's journal. The closest location that might have someone is Kargath, in the Badlands.",
[2338]="Translating the Journal|42|1517|37|6868|||6868||2318|2339|Let Jarkal borrow the necklace. In exchange, he will translate the journal for you.",
[2339]="Find the Gems and Power Source|44|1517|37|6868|||6868||2338|2340|Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath. Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman. ~ From the journal, you know... ~ * The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area. ~ * The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves. ~ * The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.",
[2340]="Deliver the Gems|44|1517|37|6868|||6986||2339|2341|Deliver the Necklace and Gem Salvage to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar.",
[2341]="Necklace Recovery, Take 3|44|1517|40|6986|||6868||2340||Visit Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath to see if he was successful.",
