[2381]="Plundering the Plunderers|18|-162|16|7161|||7161||2382||Bring the Southsea Treasure back to Wrenix the Wretched in Ratchet. Do not forget to get an E.C.A.C. and Thieves' Tools from Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus. You will need both of these items to complete your mission. ~ Should you be attacked by any unusually hostile parrots, use your E.C.A.C.!",
