[2521]="To Serve Kum'isha|55|4|45|7363|||7363|||2522|In your journeys throughout the Blasted Lands, should you ever come across a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere, take the item back to Kum'isha the Collector. ~ Be warned, this gem is one of the most rare crystals in all of Azeroth. Any creature in these lands could be holding a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere. ~ You will be rewarded for each Flawless Draenethyst Sphere you have collected.",
