[4241]="Marshal Windsor|54|1584|48|9560|||9023||4224|4242|Travel to Blackrock Mountain in the northwest and enter Blackrock Depths. Find out what became of Marshal Windsor. ~ You recall Ragged John talking about Windsor being dragged off to a prison.",
