[4262]="Overmaster Pyron|52|25|48|9561|||9561|||4263|Slay Overmaster Pyron and return to Jalinda Sprig. ~ You recall Jalinda talking about Pyron guarding the quarry. Perhaps you should search there?",
[4263]="Incendius!|56|1584|48|9561|||9561||4262||Find Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths and destroy him!",
