[4740]="WANTED: Murkdeep!|18|148|15||175320||2930||||Find and slay the murloc known as Murkdeep. The creature is thought to be defending the murloc huts south of Auberdine along the water. ~ Report the death of Murkdeep to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",
