[4906]="Further Corruption|54|361|49|9116|||9116||4421||Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed.",
[4907]="Tinkee Steamboil|60|1583|57|10468|||10267||4810|4734|Speak with Tinkee Steamboil.",
[4941]="Eitrigg's Wisdom|60|1637|55|9077|||4949||4903|4974|Speak with Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. When you have discussed matters with Eitrigg, seek council from Thrall. ~ You recall having seen Eitrigg in Thrall's chamber.",
[4961]="Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil|40|-61|35|6546|||6546||1799,4962|4976|Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha.",
[4962]="Shard of a Felhound|40|-61|35|6254|||6266||||Take the Felhas Ruby and use it on one of the Felhounds found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Felhas Ruby and the Imprisoned Felhound Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",
[4963]="Shard of an Infernal|40|-61|35|6252|||6266||||Take the Infus Emerald and use it on one of the Infernals found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Infus Emerald and the Imprisoned Infernal Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",
[4964]="The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil|40|-61|35|6266|||6266||4976,-4962||Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Dar'Orahil and then speak to her again.",
[4966]="Protect Kanati Greycloud|28|400|23|10638|||10638||4881||Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",
[4971]="A Matter of Time|56|28|53|10667|||10667|||4972|Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites. ~ Slay 10 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",
[4972]="Counting Out Time|56|28|53|10667|||10667||4971|4973|Locate 5 Andorhal Watches, found in lockboxes amongst the rubble of the city. Return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",
[4973]="Counting Out Time|56|28|53|10667|||10667||4972||Locate 5 Andorhal Watches amongst the rubble of the city, and return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",
[4974]="For The Horde!|60|1583|55|4949|||4949||4941|6566|Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand. Take his head and return to Orgrimmar.",
[4975]="The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil|40|-61|35|6266|||6266||4976,-4963||Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Noh'Orahil and then speak to her again.",
[4976]="Returning the Cleansed Orb|40|-61|35|6546|||6266||4961||Return the Cleansed Infernal Orb to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",
[4981]="Operative Bijou|59|1583|55|9080|||10257|||4982|Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou.",
[4982]="Bijou's Belongings|59|1583|55|10257|||10257||4981|4983|Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. You recall her mentioning that she stashed them on the bottom floor of the city.",
[4983]="Bijou's Reconnaissance Report|59|1583|55|10257|||9080||4982||Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath.",
[4984]="The Wildlife Suffers Too|54|28|51|10739|||10739|||4985|Destroy 8 Diseased Wolves, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.",
[4985]="The Wildlife Suffers Too|56|28|51|10739|||10739||4984||Destroy 8 Diseased Grizzlies, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.",
[4986]="Glyphed Oaken Branch|56|28|51|10739|||4217||4985||Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",
[4987]="Glyphed Oaken Branch|56|28|51|10739|||5770||4985||Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Thunder Bluff is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",
[5001]="Bijou's Belongings|59|1583|55|10257|||10257|||5002|Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. Good luck!",
[5002]="Message to Maxwell|59|1583|55|10257|||9560||5001|5081|Travel to the Burning Steppes and give Bijou's Information to Marshal Maxwell.",
[5021]="Better Late Than Never|52|28|50|10778||||175894|||The ramblings of the ghostly woman indicated that she needed a package delivered. She claimed that it was where her horse was. As to where the horse is or where the package was to be delivered - the ghost remains incomprehensible.",
[5022]="Better Late Than Never|52|28|50||175894||10782||5021|5048|Check with the Royal Factors of Stormwind to learn the whereabouts of an Emma Felstone. There is usually a census officer located in City Hall.",
[5023]="Better Late Than Never|52|28|50||175894||10781||5021|5049|Check with the Royal Overseers of the Undercity to learn the whereabouts of a Jeremiah Felstone. There is usually a census officer located near guild and tabard registration.",
[5047]="Pip Quickwit, At Your Service!|60|1583|55|10776|||10637||||Talk to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook.",
[5048]="Good Natured Emma|52|1519|50|10782|||3520||5022|5050|Find Ol' Emma in Stormwind and see if she is in fact Emma Felstone. If she is, then perhaps she'd like the package Janice Felstone made for her.",
[5049]="The Jeremiah Blues|52|1497|50|10781|||8403||5023|5050|Find Jeremiah Payson in the Undercity and see if he is in fact Jeremiah Felstone. If he is, then perhaps he'd like the package Janice Felstone made for him.",
[5050]="Good Luck Charm|52|28|50|3520,8403|||10778||5048,5049|5051|Return to Janice Felstone in Western Plaguelands her Good Luck Half-Charm.",
[5051]="Two Halves Become One|54|28|50|10778|||10778||5050||Locate the other half of the Good Luck Charm somewhere on the Felstone Farm in Western Plaguelands and reassemble it. ~ Give the Good Luck Charm to Janice Felstone on the Felstone Farm, Western Plaguelands.",
[5052]="Blood Shards of Agamaggan|21|17|14|3430|||3430||878|879|Bring a Blood Shard to Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo in the Barrens. ~ Collect more Blood Shards if you want him to bless you with Agamaggan's power.",
[5054]="Ursius of the Shardtooth|56|618|53|10303|||10303|||5055|Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Ursius.",
[5055]="Brumeran of the Chillwind|58|618|53|10303|||10303||5054|5056|Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Brumeran.",
[5056]="Shy-Rotam|60|618|53|10303|||10303||5055|5057|Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to defeat Shy-Rotam.",
[5057]="Past Endeavors|60|618|53|10303|||10303||5056||",
[5060]="Locked Away|55|28|52||175924|||175924|||",
[5061]="Aquatic Form|16|-263|16|11802|||4217||272||Return to Darnassus and show Mathrengyl Bearwalker the Pendant of the Sea Lion.",
[5062]="Sacred Fire|27|400|24|10428|||4046||4865|5088|Gather 10 bushels of Incendia Agave, and then consult Magatha Grimtotem on Elder Rise in Thunderbluff.",
[5063]="Cap of the Scarlet Savant|60|618|57||175927||10637||5047||In order to create the Cap of the Scarlet Savant, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 8 Arcane Crystals; 5 Enchanted Scarlet Thread.  ~ You will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.",
[5064]="Grimtotem Spying|28|400|24|10537|||10537||4841||Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",
[5065]="The Lost Tablets of Mosh'aru|58|139|40|10460|||10460||3528|4788|Bring the Third and Fourth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.",
[5067]="Leggings of Arcana|60|618|57||175927||10637||5047||In order to create the Leggings of Arcana, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 5 Arcanite Bars; 5 Frostwhisper's Embalming Fluid. ~ You will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.",
[5068]="Breastplate of Bloodthirst|60|618|57||175927||10637||5047||In order to create the Breastplate of Bloodthirst, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 10 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 5 Arcanite Bars; 5 Skin of Shadow. ~ You will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.",
[5081]="Maxwell's Mission|60|1583|55|9560|||9560||5002||Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy War Master Voone, Highlord Omokk, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.",
[5083]="Winterfall Firewater|56|618|52|||12771|9298|||5084|Bring the Empty Firewater Flask to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",
[5084]="Falling to Corruption|56|618|52|9298||||176091|5083|5085|Search the Deadwood furbolg camp in northern Felwood for a clue.",
[5085]="Mystery Goo|56|618|52||176091||9298||5084|5086|Report back to Donova Snowden with your findings.",
[5086]="Toxic Horrors|56|618|52|9298|||9298||5085|5087|Collect 3 Toxic Horror Droplets for Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",
[5087]="Winterfall Runners|57|618|52|9298|||9298||5086|5121|Find the Winterfall Runners and stop them from delivering their shipment to Winterfall Village.",
[5088]="Arikara|28|400|24|4046|||10428||5062||Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed.",
[5089]="General Drakkisath's Command|60|1583|55|||12780|9560|||5102|Take General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes.",
[5092]="Clear the Way|52|28|50|10838|||10838|||5097|Kill 10 Skeletal Flayers and 10 Slavering Ghouls in Sorrow Hill. ~ Return to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",
[5096]="Scarlet Diversions|53|28|50|10837|||10837|||5098|Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent. ~ Place the Scourge banner at the camp, and then return to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
[5097]="All Along the Watchtowers|56|28|50|10838|||10838||5092|5533|Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it. ~ Once all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",
[5098]="All Along the Watchtowers|56|28|50|10837|||10837||5096|838|Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it. ~ Once all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
[5102]="General Drakkisath's Demise|60|1583|55|9560|||9560||5089||Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.",
[5103]="Hot Fiery Death|60|-121|55||176090||10637|||5124|Someone in this world must know what to do with these gauntlets. Good luck!",
[5121]="High Chief Winterfall|59|618|52|9298|||9298||5087||Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.",
[5122]="The Medallion of Faith|60|2017|55|10917|||10917|||5125|",
[5123]="The Final Piece|59|618|52|||12842|9298||5087|5128|Bring the Crudely-written Log to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",
[5124]="Fiery Plate Gauntlets|60|618|55|10637|||10637||5103||Bring Malyfous Darkhammer 6 Enchanted Thorium Bars, 2 Essence of Fire, and 4 Star Rubies. You will also need to turn in your Unfired Plate Gauntlets.",
[5125]="Aurius' Reckoning|60|2017|55|10917|||10917||5122||",
[5126]="Lorax's Tale|60|-121|55|10918|||10918|||5127|Speak with Lorax. Listen to what he has to say.",
[5127]="The Demon Forge|60|1583|55|10918|||10918||5126||Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained. ~ You must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate. ~ Return both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring.",
[5128]="Words of the High Chief|59|618|52|9298|||10920||5123||Take the Crudely-written Log to Kelek Skykeeper in southern Felwood.",
[5143]="Tribal Leatherworking|55|-182|40|7870|||7870||2853||Bring a Wild Leather Vest and a Wild Leather Helmet to Caryssia Moonhunter in Feralas. ~ Completing this quest will give you access to the Tribal Leatherworking arts. ~ The completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Elemental Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",
[5147]="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem|29|400|25||176115||10537||||Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",
[5148]="Tribal Leatherworking|55|-182|40|7871|||7871||2860||Bring a Wild Leather Vest and a Wild Leather Helmet to Se'Jib in Stranglethorn Vale. ~ Completing this quest will give you access to the Tribal Leatherworking arts. ~ The completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Elemental Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",
[5149]="Pamela's Doll|55|139|50|10926|||10926||||Find Pamela's doll.",
[5150]="Dadanga is Hungry!|55|490|47|9274|||9274||||",
[5151]="Hypercapacitor Gizmo|30|400|24|10941|||10941||||Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner.",
[5152]="Auntie Marlene|56|139|50|10926|||10927||5149|5153|Speak with Marlene, south of the Ruins of Andorhal.",
[5153]="A Strange Historian|56|139|50|10927|||10667||5152|5154|Bring Joseph's Wedding Ring to Chromie.",
[5154]="The Annals of Darrowshire|56|28|50|10667|||10667||5153||Bring the Annals of Darrowshire to Chromie in Andorhal.",
[5155]="Forces of Jaedenar|51|361|48|10922|||10922|||5157|Enter Jaedenar and slay 4 Jaedenar Hounds, 4 Jaedenar Guardsmen, 6 Jaedenar Adepts, and 6 Jaedenar Cultists before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",
[5157]="Collection of the Corrupt Water|52|361|48|10922|||10922||5155|5158|Take the Empty Canteen to the Moon Well in the center of Jaedenar and fill it before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",
[5158]="Seeking Spiritual Aid|52|361|48|10922|||5901||5157|5159|Take the Corrupt Moon Well Water to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.",
[5159]="Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood|54|361|48|5901|||10922||5158|5165|Take the Purified Moon Well Water to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",
[5160]="The Matron Protectorate|60|1583|57|10740|||10929|||5161|Travel to Winterspring and find Haleh. Give her Awbee's scale.",
[5161]="Wrath of the Blue Flight|60|618|57|10929|||10929||5160|5162|Speak with Haleh if you wish to continue.",
[5162]="Wrath of the Blue Flight|60|28|57|10929|||10976||5161|5164|Speak with Jeziba in the Plaguelands. He resides in Andorhal.",
[5163]="Are We There, Yeti?|58|618|52|10305|||10305||977|8798|Take Umi's Mechanical Yeti and scare her friends with it: ~ Legacki in Everlook (Winterspring) ~ Sprinkle in Gadgetzan (Tanaris) ~ Quixxil in Marshal's Refuge (Un'Goro Crater) ~ When you are done, bring the Mechanical Yeti back to Umi.",
[5164]="Catalogue of the Wayward|60|28|57|10976||||176192|5162||Read from the Catalogue of the Wayward.",
[5165]="Dousing the Flames of Protection|55|361|48|10922|||10922||5159|5242|Using the Purified Moon Well Water, douse the flames of the four braziers of protection within Shadow Hold in Felwood, then return to Greta Mosshoof in the Emerald Sanctuary.",
[5166]="Breastplate of the Chromatic Flight|60|28|57||176192||10976||5164||To forge the Breastplate of the Chromatic Flight, you will be required to bring the following items to Jeziba the 'Sculptor': ~ 1 Chromatic Carapace. ~ 10 Brilliant Chromatic Scales. ~ 10 Blood of Heroes. ~ 10 Frayed Abomination Stitchings.",
[5167]="Legplates of the Chromatic Defier|60|28|57||176192||10976||5164||To forge the Legplates of the Chromatic Defier, you will be required to bring the following items to Jeziba the 'Sculptor': ~ 1 Chromatic Carapace. ~ 10 Brilliant Chromatic Scales. ~ 10 Blood of Heroes. ~ 5 Skin of Shadow.",
[5168]="Heroes of Darrowshire|56|139|50|11063|||11063||5210||Bring Davil's Libram and Redpath's Shield to Carlin Redpath.",
[5181]="Villains of Darrowshire|57|139|50|11063|||11063||5210||Bring the Skull of Horgus and the Shattered Sword of Marduk to Carlin Redpath at Light's Hope Chapel.",
[5202]="A Strange Red Key|55|361|49|||13140|11016|||5203|Search through Jaedenar to discover what the Blood Red Key is used for.",
[5203]="Rescue From Jaedenar|55|361|49|11016|||11019||5202|5204|Escort Arko'narin to where Lightforge and her equipment are being held, and then protect her as you escape Shadow Hold. Afterwards, seek out Jessir Moonbow in Felwood to let her know what's happened to her friends.",
[5204]="Retribution of the Light|57|361|49|11019|||11020||5203|5385|Return to Jaedenar and kill the succubus Rakaiah before finding the Remains of Trey Lightforge.",
[5206]="Marauders of Darrowshire|60|139|50|11063|||11063||5168,5181|5941|Bring 5 Resonating Skulls and the Mystic Crystal to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.",
[5210]="Brother Carlin|56|139|50|10667|||11063||5154|5181|Bring the Extended Annals of Darrowshire to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.",
[5212]="The Flesh Does Not Lie|60|2017|55|11035|||11035|||5213|Recover 10 Plagued Flesh Samples from Stratholme and return them to Betina Bigglezink. You suspect that any creature in Stratholme would have said flesh sample.",
[5213]="The Active Agent|60|2017|55|11035|||11035||5212||Travel to Stratholme and search the ziggurats. Find and return new Scourge Data to Betina Bigglezink.",
[5214]="The Great Ezra Grimm|60|2017|55|11033|||11033||||Find Ezra Grimm's smoke shop in Stratholme and recover a box of Grimm's Premium Tobacco. Return to Smokey LaRue when the job is done.",
[5215]="The Scourge Cauldrons|53|28|50|10838|||11053||5092|5216|Speak with High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
[5216]="Target: Felstone Field|53|28|50|11053||||176361|5215|5217|Go to Felstone Field in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there. It may have a key that will allow access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Felstone Field Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",
[5217]="Return to Chillwind Camp|53|28|50||176361||11053||5216|5219|Bring the Filled Felstone Field Bottle to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",
