[5251]="The Archivist|60|2017|55|11039|||11039|||5262|Travel to Stratholme and find Archivist Galford of the Scarlet Crusade. Destroy him and burn down the Scarlet Archive.",
[5252]="Remorseful Highborne|58|618|53|10684|||11079||5248|5253|Speak with Wynd Nightchaser in Starfall Village, and ask about the proper place for the Crystal of Zin-Malor.",
[5253]="The Crystal of Zin-Malor|58|618|53|11079|||3516||5252||Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",
[5262]="The Truth Comes Crashing Down|60|2017|55|||13250|11039||5251|5263|Take the Head of Balnazzar to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff in the Eastern Plaguelands.",
[5263]="Above and Beyond|60|2017|55|11039|||11039||5262|5264|Venture to Stratholme and destroy Baron Rivendare. Take his head and return to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff.",
[5264]="Lord Maxwell Tyrosus|60|139|55|11039|||11034||5263|5265|Speak with Lord Maxwell Tyrosus. He is inside the church.",
[5265]="The Argent Hold|60|139|55|11034||||176317|5264||Open the Argent Hold and claim your reward.",
[5281]="The Restless Souls|60|139|55|11038|||11140|||5282|Find Egan. You only know that he was last seen around Stratholme.",
[5282]="The Restless Souls|60|2017|55|11140|||11140||5281||Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs! ~ Free 15 Restless Souls and return to Egan.",
[5305]="Sweet Serenity|60|-121|50|11191|||11191||||Travel to Stratholme and kill the Crimson Hammersmith. Recover the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron and return to Lilith.",
[5306]="Snakestone of the Shadow Huntress|60|-121|50|11192|||11192||||Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. Recover Vosh'gajin's Snakestone and return to Kilram.",
[5307]="Corruption|60|-121|50|11193|||11193||||Find the Black Guard Swordsmith in Stratholme and destroy him. Recover the Insignia of the Black Guard and return to Seril Scourgebane.",
[5321]="The Sleeper Has Awakened|20|148|17|11218|||11219||||Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",
[5341]="Barov Family Fortune|60|2057|52|11022|||11022|||5342|Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.",
[5342]="The Last Barov|60|28|52|11022|||11022||5341||Travel to Chillwind Camp - Alliance territory - and assassinate Weldon Barov. Take his head and return to Alexi Barov. ~ Be warned, Weldon will probably be well protected by Alliance scum.",
[5343]="Barov Family Fortune|60|2057|52|11023|||11023|||5344|Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.",
[5344]="The Last Barov|60|28|52|11023|||11023||5343||Travel to the Bulwark - Horde territory - and assassinate Alexi Barov. Take his head and return to Weldon Barov. ~ Be warned, Alexi will probably be well protected by Horde filth.",
[5381]="Hand of Iruxos|38|405|32|11624|||11624|||5581|Retrieve the Demon Box from Thunder Axe Fortress, and return it, along with the Demon Pick to Taiga Wisemane in Shadowprey Village.",
[5382]="Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher|60|2057|55|11216|||11216|||5515|Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete.",
[5384]="Kirtonos the Herald|60|2057|55|11216|||11216||5515|5461|Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul. ~ Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.",
[5385]="The Remains of Trey Lightforge|57|361|49|11020|||11019||5204||Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood.",
[5386]="Catch of the Day|37|405|32|11259|||11259||||Talk to Jinar'Zillen at Shadowprey Village, and then bring Nataka Longhorn 2 Bloodbelly fish.",
