[5461]="The Human, Ras Frostwhisper|60|28|57|11286|||11286||5384|5462|Travel to the Arathi Highlands, to the ruins of Stromgarde. Search Stromgarde for a Keepsake of Remembrance. If you find such an item, return with it to Magistrate Marduke.",
[5462]="The Dying, Ras Frostwhisper|60|28|57|11286|||11036||5461|5463|Travel to Light's Hope in Eastern Plaguelands and seek out Leonid Barthalomew the Revered. Show him the Keepsake of Remembrance and tell him all that you have discovered.",
[5463]="Menethil's Gift|60|2017|57|11036||||176631|5462|5464|Travel to Stratholme and find Menethil's Gift. Place the Keepsake of Remembrance upon the unholy ground.",
