[5465]="Soulbound Keepsake|60|28|57|11036|||11286||5464|5466|Return to Magistrate Marduke in Caer Darrow. Show him the Soulbound Keepsake.",
[5466]="The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper|60|2057|57|11286|||11286||5465||Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke.",
