[5518]="The Gordok Ogre Suit|60|2557|56|14338|||14338|||5519|Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack. He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul.",
