[5533]="Scholomance|55|28|55|10838|||11056||5097|5537|Speak with Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
[5534]="Kim'jael's \"Missing\" Equipment|53|16|47|8420|||8420||3601||Find Some Rune that the naga have in their possession in the Ruins of Eldarath and return it to Kim'jael in Azshara.",
