[5542]="Demon Dogs|56|139|52|1855,12126|||1855|||5742|Slay 20 Plaguehound Runts, 5 Plaguehounds and 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds. Return to Tirion Fordring when the task is complete.",
[5543]="Blood Tinged Skies|56|139|52|1855,12126|||1855|||5742|Slay 30 Plaguebats and return to Tirion Fordring.",
[5544]="Carrion Grubbage|56|139|52|1855,12126|||1855|||5742|Seek out the Carrion Grubs and Devourers of the region. Slay them and harvest their meat. Return to Tirion Fordring when you have gathered 15 Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat.",
[5561]="Kodo Roundup|34|405|30|11596|||11596||||Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",
