[5582]="Healthy Dragon Scale|58|2057|55|||13920|11035||5529||Bring the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",
[5621]="Garments of the Moon|4|-262|5|3600|||3600||||Find Sentinel Shaya and heal her wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant her Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Laurna Morninglight in Dolanaar.",
[5624]="Garments of the Light|4|-262|5|377|||377||||Find Guard Roberts and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Priestess Josetta in Goldshire.",
[5625]="Garments of the Light|4|-262|5|1226|||1226||||Find Mountaineer Dolf and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Maxan Anvol in Kharanos.",
[5648]="Garments of Spirituality|4|-262|5|3706|||3706||||Find Grunt Kor'ja and heal her wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant her Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Tai'jin at Razor Hill.",
[5650]="Garments of Darkness|4|-262|5|2129|||2129||||Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill.",
[5721]="The Battle of Darrowshire|60|139|55|10667|||10926||5941|5942|Place the Relic Bundle at the Darrowshire town square. ~ Prevent Davil Lightfire's death until the death of Horgus. ~ Prevent Captain Redpath's death until Redpath the Corrupted appears. ~ Defeat Redpath the Corrupted. ~ Speak with the spirit of Joseph Redpath when he appears at the town square, then speak with Pamela at her home.",
[5722]="Searching for the Lost Satchel|16|2437|9|11833|||11834|||5724|Search Ragefire Chasm for Maur Grimtotem's corpse and search it for any items of interest.",
[5724]="Returning the Lost Satchel|16|2437|9|11834|||11833||5722||Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",
[5725]="The Power to Destroy...|16|2437|9|2425|||2425||||Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",
[5726]="Hidden Enemies|12|1637|9|4949|||4949|||5727|Bring a Lieutenant's Insignia to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
[5727]="Hidden Enemies|12|1637|9|4949|||4949||5726|5728|Take the Lieutenant's Insignia to Neeru Fireblade and speak to him. Gauge if he believes you are a member of the Burning Blade and then return to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
[5728]="Hidden Enemies|16|2437|9|4949|||4949||5727|5729|Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
[5729]="Hidden Enemies|15|1637|9|4949|||3216||5728|5730|Speak to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar.",
[5730]="Hidden Enemies|16|1637|9|3216|||4949||5729||Speak to Thrall in Orgrimmar and tell him what you've learned.",
[5741]="Sceptre of Light|33|405|30|11863|||11863|||6027|Get the Sceptre of Light and then return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor.",
[5742]="Redemption|56|139|52|1855|||1855||5542,5543,5544|5781|Listen to what Tirion Fordring has to say.",
[5781]="Of Forgotten Memories|57|139|52|1855|||1855||5742|5845|Travel to the Undercroft - at the southernmost section of the Eastern Plaguelands - and recover Taelan's Hammer. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective.",
[5801]="Fire Plume Forged|57|440|55|5411|||11056||5538|5803|Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key. ~ Bring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
[5802]="Fire Plume Forged|57|440|55|5411|||11057||5514|5804|Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key. ~ Bring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
[5803]="Araj's Scarab|60|28|55|11056|||11056||5801|5505|Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
[5804]="Araj's Scarab|60|28|55|11057|||11057||5802|5511|Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
