[5844]="Welcome!|1|221|1|||14650|11944||||Bring the Camp Narache Gift Voucher to Vorn Skyseer.",
[5845]="Of Lost Honor|58|139|52|1855|||1855||5781|5846|Travel to Northdale, in the northeastern region of the Eastern Plaguelands, and recover the Symbol of Lost Honor. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective.",
[5846]="Of Love and Family|58|139|52|1855|||11936||5845|5848|Travel to island of Caer Darrow, in the south-central region of the Plaguelands, and look for any clues as to the whereabouts of the painting.",
[5847]="Welcome!|1|154|1|||14651|11945||||Bring the Deathknell Gift Voucher to Claire Willower in Deathknell.",
[5848]="Of Love and Family|60|2017|52|11936|||1855||5846|5861|Travel to Stratholme, in the northern part of the Plaguelands. It is in the Scarlet Bastion that you will find the painting 'Of Love and Family,' hidden behind another painting depicting the twin moons of our world. ~ Return the painting to Tirion Fordring.",
[5861]="Find Myranda|60|28|52|1855|||11872||5848|5862|Travel to Uther's Tomb, located in the southern Plaguelands. Show Myranda the Hag Tirion's Gift.",
[5862]="Scarlet Subterfuge|60|28|52|11872|||1842||5861|5944|Speak to Myranda to gain the Scarlet Illusion. Travel to Hearthglen while under the Scarlet Illusion and deliver Tirion's Gift to Highlord Taelan Fordring. ~ Hearthglen is to the north, Taelan should be inside of Mardenholde Keep.",
[5863]="The Dunemaul Compound|49|440|44|11758|||11758||||Andi Lynn in Gadgetzan wants you to destroy the Dunemaul Compound by killing 10 Dunemaul Brutes, 10 Dunemaul Enforcers, and Gor'marok the Ravager.",
