[5944]="In Dreams|60|28|52|1842|||1855,12126||5862||Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",
[6022]="To Kill With Purpose|58|139|54|11878|||11878||||Travel to Corin's Crossing to the east and slaughter the Scourge that inhabit the town. Collect 7 pieces of Living Rot in under 10 minutes. Use the Mortar and Pestle to grind the Living Rot into Coagulated Rot.",
[6024]="Hameya's Plea|60|139|54||177667|||177675|||Kill Infiltrator Hameya. Use his key on the Mound of Dirt behind the Undercroft.",
[6026]="That's Asking A Lot|58|139|54|11033|||11033|||6041|Smokey LaRue wants you to get 2 Thorium Bars, 1 Golden Rod, 8 Hi-Explosive Bombs, and 8 Unstable Triggers. ~ You will have to find a blacksmith and an engineer for these items.",
[6027]="Book of the Ancients|38|405|30|11863|||11863||5741||Get the Book of the Ancients and return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor.",
[6031]="Runecloth|55|1769|50|11557|||11557||||Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",
[6041]="When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent|58|139|54|11033|||11033||6026||Travel to Plaguewood, northwest of Light's Hope. Destroy 8 Scourge Structures by using Smokey's Special Compound at the Mark of Detonation planted inside each building. Smokey has had the Ziggurats and Slaughterhouses marked. ~ Once you plant the bomb, leave the building and marvel at your handiwork. ~ By the way, Smokey's Special Compound is rather... unstable.",
[6042]="Un-Life's Little Annoyances|58|139|54|11878|||11878||||Slay 20 Noxious Plaguebats and 10 Monstrous Plaguebats. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when you are finished.",
[6121]="Lessons Anew|14|-263|14|4217,270459|||11802|||6122|Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",
[6122]="The Principal Source|14|-263|14|11802|||3702||6121|6123|Use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler to draw a sample of water from the mouth of the cave by the falls. ~ Deliver the Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine, Darkshore.",
[6123]="Gathering the Cure|14|-263|14|3702|||3702||6122|6124|Bring 5 Earthroot and 12 Lunar Funguses to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine so she may make a curative salve.",
[6124]="Curing the Sick|14|-263|14|3702|||11802||6123|6125|Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them. Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins.",
[6125]="Power over Poison|14|-263|14|11802|||4217||6124||Return to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",
[6126]="Lessons Anew|14|-263|14|3033,262560|||11802|||6127|Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",
[6127]="The Principal Source|14|-263|14|11802|||3448||6126|6128|Use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler to draw a sample of water from a pool at the top of the peak. ~ Deliver the Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads, Barrens.",
[6128]="Gathering the Cure|14|-263|14|3448|||3448||6127|6129|Bring 5 Earthroot and 5 Kodo Horns to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads so he may make a curative salve.",
[6129]="Curing the Sick|14|-263|14|3448|||11802||6128|6130|Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Gazelles that are located throughout the northern part of the Barrens; doing so should cure them. Sickly Gazelles have been reported north of the east-west road that runs through the Crossroads.",
[6130]="Power over Poison|14|-263|14|11802|||3033||6129||Return to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff.",
[6133]="The Ranger Lord's Behest|60|139|54|11878|||11878||||Travel to the northern borders of the Eastern Plaguelands and recover the Quel'Thalas Registry. The item is somewhere in the Quel'Lithien lodge. ~ You must also slay 8 Rangers, 8 Pathstriders, and 8 Woodsmen.",
[6134]="Ghost-o-plasm Round Up|39|405|34|6019|||6019||||Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.",
[6135]="Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...|60|139|56|11878|||11878||6022,6042,6133||Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller. ~ It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead.",
[6136]="The Corpulent One|60|139|56|11878|||11878||6022,6042,6133||Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete.",
[6142]="Clam Bait|35|405|31|12031|||12031||||Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village.",
[6144]="The Call to Command|60|139|56|11878|||2425||6135,6136|6145|Travel to the Undercity and speak with Varimathras.",
[6145]="The Crimson Courier|60|139|56|2425|||11878||6144|6146|Return to Eastern Plaguelands and track down the Crimson Courier. Kill the Courier and recover the Grand Crusader's Command. ~ Take the command to Nathanos Blightcaller for further instruction.",
[6146]="Nathanos' Ruse|60|139|56|11878|||11898||6145|6147|Travel to Tyr's Hand, southeast of the Marris Stead. Once there, take a bite of the Rotten Apple. While under the guise of the Scarlet Crusade, deliver the Grand Crusader's Command to Crusader Lord Valdelmar.",
[6147]="Return to Nathanos|60|139|56|11898|||11878||6146|6148|Return to Nathanos Blightcaller with the new information.",
[6148]="The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria|60|139|56|11878|||11878||6147||The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed.",
[6161]="Claim Rackmore's Treasure!|36|405|30||177787|||177786|||Find Rackmore's Silver Key. Find Rackmore's Golden Key. Find and open Rackmore's Chest.",
[6163]="Ramstein|60|2017|56|11878|||11878||6135,6136||Travel to Stratholme and slay Ramstein the Gorger. Take his head as a souvenir for Nathanos.",
[6182]="The First and the Last|60|1519|56|1748|||332|||6183|Speak with Mathias Shaw in Old Town Stormwind. He resides in the Barracks.",
[6183]="Honor the Dead|60|1519|56|332|||332||6182|6184|Speak with Mathias Shaw again if you wish to accept his task.",
[6184]="Flint Shadowmore|60|28|56|332|||12425||6183|6185|Travel to Chillwind Camp in the Western Plaguelands and meet up with your contact, Flint Shadowmore.",
[6185]="The Eastern Plagues|60|139|56|12425|||12425||6184|6186|Scour the Eastern Plaguelands for clues as to the \"Blightcaller\" and the missing SI:7 agents. If you find any SI:7 Insignias, return them to Flint Shadowmore at Chillwind Camp.",
[6186]="The Blightcaller Cometh|60|1519|56|12425|||1748||6185|6187|Return to Stormwind and inform Highlord Bolvar Fordragon of the fate of Nathanos Marris.",
[6187]="Order Must Be Restored|60|139|56|1748|||1748||6186||Assemble an army and travel to the Eastern Plaguelands. Launch a full assault on Nathanos Blightcaller and any Horde filth that may attempt to protect him. ~ Keep your wits about you, <Name>. The Horde will defend the ranger lord with their very lives.",
[6282]="Harpies Threaten|26|406|18|11860|||11860|||6283|Maggran Earthbinder in Sun Rock Retreat wants you to slay 7 Bloodfury Harpies, 7 Bloodfury Ambushers, 7 Bloodfury Slayers and 7 Bloodfury Roguefeathers.",
[6283]="Bloodfury Bloodline|26|406|18|11860|||11860||6282||Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.",
[6284]="Arachnophobia|21|406|15||177904||11860||||Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat.",
[6301]="Cycle of Rebirth|23|406|17|11864|||11864|||6381|Tammra Windfield at Sun Rock Retreat wants you to gather 10 Gaea Seeds.",
[6321]="Supplying the Sepulcher|10|130|10|6389|||2226|||6323|Bring Podrig's Order to Karos Razok.",
[6322]="Michael Garrett|10|130|10|4556|||4551||6323|6324|Bring Gordon's Crate to Michael Garrett.",
[6323]="Ride to the Undercity|10|130|10|2226|||4556||6321|6322|Buy a bat ride to the Undercity from the bat master Karos Razok, then take Podrig's Order to Gordon Wendham in the Undercity.",
[6324]="Return to Podrig|10|130|10|4551|||6389||6322||Buy a bat ride to the Sepulcher from the bat master Michael Garrett, then bring Gordon's Crate to Deathguard Podrig in the Sepulcher.",
[6381]="New Life|25|406|17|11864|||11864||6301||Plant 10 Gaea Seeds in Gaea Dirt Mounds, and then return the remaining Enchanted Gaea Seeds to Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat.",
[6383]="The Ashenvale Hunt|20|331|20|12696|||12696||||",
[6395]="Marla's Last Wish|5|154|3|1661|||1661||376||Bring Samuel Fipps' Remains to Marla's Grave, then return to Novice Elreth.",
[6402]="Stormwind Rendezvous|60|1519|50|9560|||12580||4322|6403|Travel to Stormwind City and venture to the city gates. Speak with Squire Rowe so that he may let Marshal Windsor know that you have arrived.",
[6403]="The Great Masquerade|60|1519|50|12580|||1748||6402|6501|Follow Reginald Windsor through Stormwind. Protect him from harm!",
[6421]="Boulderslide Ravine|18|406|14|11861|||11861|||6481|Explore deep into the cave at Boulderslide Ravine and bring back 10 Resonite Crystals for Mor'rogal at Sun Rock Retreat to investigate.",
[6481]="Earthen Arise|20|406|14|11861|||11861||6421||Open the Resonite cask with the Enchanted Resonite Crystal, and then slay Goggeroc. Return to Mor'rogal with the news and Enchanted Resonite Crystal.",
[6501]="The Dragon's Eye|60|1519|50|1748|||10929||6403|6502|You must search the world for a being capable of restoring the power to the Fragment of the Dragon's Eye. The only information you possess about such a being is that they exist.",
[6502]="Drakefire Amulet|60|1583|50|10929|||10929||6501||You must retrieve the Blood of the Black Dragon Champion from General Drakkisath. Drakkisath can be found in his throne room behind the Halls of Ascension in Blackrock Spire.",
[6504]="The Lost Pages|30|331|23|12718|||12718||||Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post.",
[6521]="An Unholy Alliance|36|722|28|2425|||2425||6522||Bring Ambassador Malcin's Head to Varimathras in the Undercity.",
[6522]="An Unholy Alliance|36|722|28|||17008|2425|||6521|Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity.",
[6543]="The Warsong Reports|19|17|17|8582|||8582||||Open the Bundle of Reports. Take the Warsong Reports to the Warsong Scout, Warsong Runner, and Warsong Outrider. Bring back the updates they give you to Kadrak at the northern watch tower in the barrens.",
[6544]="Torek's Assault|24|331|20|12858|||12877||||Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post.",
[6545]="Warsong Runner Update|19|331|17|12863|||12863||||",
[6546]="Warsong Outrider Update|25|331|17|12864|||12864||||",
[6547]="Warsong Scout Update|21|331|17|12862|||12862||||",
[6561]="Blackfathom Villainy|27|719|18|4787|||9087||||Bring the head of Twilight Lord Kelris to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",
[6562]="Trouble in the Deeps|22|719|17|11862|||12736|||6563|Speak to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",
[6563]="The Essence of Aku'Mai|22|719|17|12736|||12736||||Bring 20 Sapphires of Aku'Mai to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",
[6564]="Allegiance to the Old Gods|22|719|17|||16790|12736||6562|6565|Bring the Damp Note to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",
[6565]="Allegiance to the Old Gods|26|719|17|12736|||12736||6564||Kill Lorgus Jett in Blackfathom Deeps and then return to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",
[6566]="What the Wind Carries|60|1637|55|4949|||4949||4974|6567|Listen to Thrall.",
[6567]="The Champion of the Horde|60|1637|55|4949|||10182||6566|6568|Seek out Rexxar. The Warchief has instructed you as to his whereabouts. Search the paths of Desolace, between the Stonetalon Mountains and Feralas.",
[6568]="The Testament of Rexxar|60|405|55|10182|||11872||6567|6569|Deliver Rexxar's Letter to Myranda the Hag in the Western Plaguelands.",
[6569]="Oculus Illusions|60|1583|55|11872|||11872||6568|6570|Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete.",
[6570]="Emberstrife|60|15|55|11872|||10321||6569||Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh and seek out Emberstrife's Den. Once inside, wear the Amulet of Draconic Subversion and speak with Emberstrife.",
[6571]="Warsong Supplies|27|331|22|11820|||11820||||Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post.",
[6581]="Warsong Saw Blades|27|331|22|12724|||12724||||",
[6582]="The Test of Skulls, Scryer|60|15|55|10321|||10321||6570||You must find the blue dragonflight drake champion, Scryer, and slay him. Pry his skull from his corpse and return it to Emberstrife. ~ You know that Scryer can be found in Winterspring.",
[6583]="The Test of Skulls, Somnus|60|15|55|10321|||10321||6570||Destroy the drake champion of the Green Flight, Somnus. Take his skull and return it to Emberstrife.",
[6584]="The Test of Skulls, Chronalis|60|15|55|10321|||10321||6570||Guarding the Caverns of Time in the Tanaris Desert is Chronalis, child of Nozdormu. Destroy him and return his skull to Emberstrife.",
[6585]="The Test of Skulls, Axtroz|60|15|55|10321|||10321||6582,6583,6584|6601|Travel to Grim Batol and track down Axtroz, drake champion of the Red Flight. Destroy him and take his skull. Return the skull to Emberstrife.",
[6601]="Ascension...|60|15|55|10321|||10182||6585|6602|It would appear as if the charade is over. You know that the Amulet of Draconic Subversion that Myranda the Hag created for you will not function inside Blackrock Spire. Perhaps you should find Rexxar and explain your predicament. Show him the Dull Drakefire Amulet. Hopefully he will know what to do next.",
[6602]="Blood of the Black Dragon Champion|60|1583|55|10182|||10182||6601||Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar.",
[6607]="Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme|45|-101|35|12919|||12919||||Nat Pagle wants you to catch the following fish: ~ Misty Reed Mahi Mahi from the Misty Reed Strand in the Swamp of Sorrows. ~ A Sar'theris Striker from the Sar'theris Strand in Desolace. ~ Feralas Ahi from the Verdantis River of Feralas. ~ Savage Coast Blue Sailfin from the Savage Coast of Stranglethorn Vale. ~ Return to Nat Pagle when you have reeled them all in!",
[6610]="Clamlette Surprise|45|-304|35|8125|||8125||||Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items: ~ 12 Giant Eggs. You will find those on the Rocs wandering Tanaris or any other species of large bird. ~ 10 pieces of Zesty Clam Meat. You can find those in clams, naturally! ~ 20 pieces of Alterac Swiss. Get thee to a cheesery! ~ Gather all of the items and return to Dirge.",
[6621]="King of the Foulweald|26|331|21|12757|||12757||216||Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar.",
[6627]="Test of Lore|30|400|25|4489|||4489||1154|1159|Answer Braug Dimspirit's question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in Stonetalon Mountains when you are ready.",
[6628]="Test of Lore|30|400|25|4488|||4488||1160|1394|Answer Parqual Fintallas' question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in the Undercity until you are ready.",
[6641]="Vorsha the Lasher|23|331|20|12717|||12863||||Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga. ~ If you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",
[6661]="Deeprun Rat Roundup|12|2257|10|12997|||12997|||6662|Capture 5 Deeprun Rats by using the Rat Catcher's Flute. Lead the rats back to Monty. Don't forget to turn in the flute when you're finished.",
[6662]="Me Brother, Nipsy|12|2257|10|12997|||13018||6661||Take the Carton of Mystery Meat to Nipsy at the Stormwind Deeprun Tram Depot.",
[6681]="The Manor, Ravenholdt|24|-162|24|||17126|6707|||6701|Take the Seal of Ravenholdt to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor, hidden away in the hills of Hillsbrad. ~ Your cunning will be tested along the way. Be prepared.",
[6701]="Syndicate Emblems|60|-162|24|6766|||6766||6681||",
[6761]="The New Frontier|55|1657|54|3516|||4217||1015,1019,1047|6762|Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker at the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus.",
[6762]="Rabine Saturna|55|1657|54|4217|||11801||6761|1124|Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade. Moonglade lies between Felwood and Winterspring, accessible through a path out of Timbermaw Hold.",
[6804]="Poisoned Water|56|16|55|13278|||13278||||Use the Aspect of Neptulon on poisoned elementals of Eastern Plaguelands. Bring 12 Discordant Bracers and the Aspect of Neptulon to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",
[6805]="Stormers and Rumblers|57|16|55|13278|||13278||||Kill 15 Dust Stormers and 15 Desert Rumblers and then return to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",
[6821]="Eye of the Emberseer|60|16|56|13278|||13278||6804,6805|6822|Bring the Eye of the Emberseer to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",
[6822]="The Molten Core|60|16|57|13278|||13278||6821|6823|Kill 1 Fire Lord, 1 Molten Giant, 1 Ancient Core Hound and 1 Lava Surger, then return to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",
[6823]="Agent of Hydraxis|60|16|60|13278|||13278||6822|6824|Earn an Honored faction with the Hydraxian Waterlords, then talk to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",
[6824]="Hands of the Enemy|60|16|60|13278|||13278||6823|7486|Bring the Hands of Lucifron, Sulfuron, Gehennas and Shazzrah to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",
[6844]="Umber, Archivist|57|1377|54|13220|||11939||1126|6845|Take the Encrusted Silithid Object to Umber - the Cenarion Circle's archivist - in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.",
[6845]="Uncovering Past Secrets|57|493|54|11939|||11801||6844|1185|Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.",
[6861]="Zinfizzlex's Portable Shredder Unit|60|2597|51|13377|||13377||||",
[6862]="Zinfizzlex's Portable Shredder Unit|60|2597|51|13377|||13377||||",
[6922]="Baron Aquanis|30|719|21|||16782|12736||||Bring the Strange Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.",
[6962]="Treats for Great-father Winter|60|-22|10|13445|||13445||||Bring 5 Gingerbread Cookies and an Ice Cold Milk to Greatfather Winter in Orgrimmar.",
[6963]="Stolen Winter Veil Treats|60|-22|30|13418|||13636|||6983|Locate the Smokywood Pastures investigator that has gone missing in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",
[6981]="The Glowing Shard|26|718|15|||10441|8418||||Travel to Ratchet to find someone that can tell you more about the glowing shard. ~ Then, deliver the shard as you are directed.",
[6983]="You're a Mean One...|35|-22|30|13636|||13418||6963|6984|Locate and return the Stolen Treats to Kaymard Copperpinch in Orgrimmar. It was last thought to be in the possession of the Abominable Greench, found somewhere in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",
[6984]="A Smokywood Pastures' Thank You!|60|-22|30|13418|||13445||6983||Speak with Great-father Winter in Orgrimmar.",
[7003]="Zapped Giants|48|357|45|14637|||14637|||7725|Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",
[7025]="Treats for Greatfather Winter|60|-22|10|13444|||13444||||Bring 5 Gingerbread Cookies and an Ice Cold Milk to Greatfather Winter in Ironforge.",
[7028]="Twisted Evils|47|2100|41|13656|||13656||||Collect 15 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",
[7029]="Vyletongue Corruption|47|2100|41|11823|||11823||||Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon. ~ Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge. ~ Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village.",
[7041]="Vyletongue Corruption|47|2100|41|11715|||11715||||Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon. ~ Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge. ~ Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Talendria in Nijel's Point.",
[7042]="Stolen Winter Veil Treats|60|-22|30|13433|||13636|||7043|Locate the Smokywood Pastures investigator that has gone missing in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",
[7043]="You're a Mean One...|35|-22|30|13636|||13433||7042|7045|Locate and return the Stolen Treats to Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge. It was last thought to be in the possession of the Abominable Greench, found somewhere in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",
[7044]="Legends of Maraudon|49|2100|41|13697|||13716|||7046|Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond. ~ Find a way to speak with Celebras.",
[7045]="A Smokywood Pastures' Thank You!|60|-22|30|13433|||13444||7043||Speak with Greatfather Winter in Ironforge.",
[7046]="The Scepter of Celebras|49|2100|41|13716|||13716||7044||Assist Celebras the Redeemed while he creates the Scepter of Celebras. ~ Speak with him when the ritual is complete.",
[7064]="Corruption of Earth and Seed|51|2100|45|13699|||13699||||Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",
[7065]="Corruption of Earth and Seed|51|2100|45|13698|||13698||||Slay Princess Theradras and return to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",
[7067]="The Pariah's Instructions|48|2100|39|13717|||13717||||Read the Pariah's Instructions. Afterwards, obtain the Amulet of Union from Maraudon and return it to the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace.",
[7068]="Shadowshard Fragments|42|2100|39|7311|||7311||||Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar.",
[7070]="Shadowshard Fragments|42|2100|39|4967|||4967||||Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Archmage Tervosh in Theramore on the coast of Dustwallow Marsh.",
[7141]="The Battle of Alterac|60|2597|51|13816|||13816|||8271|Enter Alterac Valley, defeat the Horde general Drek'thar, and then return to Prospector Stonehewer in the Alterac Mountains.",
[7142]="The Battle for Alterac|60|2597|51|13817|||13817|||8272|Enter Alterac Valley and defeat the dwarven general, Vanndar Stormpike. Then, return to Voggah Deathgrip in the Alterac Mountains.",
[7161]="Proving Grounds|60|2597|51|13840|||13840|||7163|Travel to the Wildpaw cavern located southeast of the main base in Alterac Valley and find the Frostwolf Banner. Return the Frostwolf Banner to Warmaster Laggrond.",
[7162]="Proving Grounds|60|2597|51|13841|||13841|||7168|Travel to the Icewing Caverns located southwest of Dun Baldar in Alterac Valley and recover the Stormpike Banner. Return the Stormpike Banner to Lieutenant Haggerdin in the Alterac Mountains.",
