[7181]="The Legend of Korrak|60|2597|51||||13840||||According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley. ~ Should Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Warmaster Laggrond.",
[7201]="The Last Element|54|1584|48|9078|||9078||3906||Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.",
[7202]="Korrak the Bloodrager|60|2597|51||||13841||||According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley. ~ Should Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Lieutenant Haggerdin in the Alterac Mountains.",
[7321]="Soothing Turtle Bisque|31|-304|28|2393|||2393||||Bring 10 pieces of Turtle Meat and some Soothing Spices to Christoph Jeffcoat in Tarren Mill.",
[7341]="A Fair Trade|60|1637|52|14182|||14182||||",
[7342]="Arrows Are For Sissies|60|1537|52|14183|||14183||||",
[7381]="The Return of Korrak|60|2597|51||||13840||||Should Korrak the Bloodrager make a return to the Field of Strife, seek him out and destroy him. ~ Return the Skull of Korrak to Warmaster Laggrond in the Hillsbrad Foothills.",
[7382]="Korrak the Everliving|60|2597|51||||13841||||Should Korrak the Bloodrager make a return to the Field of Strife, seek him out and destroy him. ~ Return the Skull of Korrak to Lieutenant Haggerdin in the Hillsbrad Foothills.",
[7383]="Crown of the Earth|11|141|1|3515|||3515||933|935|Fill the Amethyst Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar.",
[7441]="Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin|58|2557|54|14355|||14355||||Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary. ~ Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",
[7461]="The Madness Within|60|2557|56|14358|||14358|||7877|You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated. ~ Enter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum. ~ Return to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.",
[7462]="The Treasure of the Shen'dralar|60|2557|56|14358||||179517|7461||Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",
[7481]="Elven Legends|60|2557|54|14373|||14373||||Search Dire Maul for Telmius Dreamseeker. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find.",
[7482]="Elven Legends|60|2557|54|14374|||14374||||Search Dire Maul for Telmius Dreamseeker. Report back to Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon with whatever information that you may find.",
[7483]="Libram of Rapidity|60|2557|58|14368|||14368||7481,7482||Bring a Libram of Rapidity, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Blood of Heroes to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Rapidity.",
[7484]="Libram of Focus|60|2557|58|14368|||14368||7481,7482||Bring a Libram of Focus, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 4 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Skin of Shadow to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Focus.",
[7485]="Libram of Protection|60|2557|58|14368|||14368||7481,7482||Bring a Libram of Protection, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 1 Frayed Abomination Stitching to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Protection.",
[7486]="A Hero's Reward|60|16|60|13278||||179551|6824||Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer.",
[7488]="Lethtendris's Web|57|2557|54|7877|||7877||||Bring Lethtendris' Web to Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",
[7489]="Lethtendris's Web|57|2557|54|7776|||7776||||Bring Lethtendris's Web to Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",
