[7677]="White Stallion Exchange|1|12|60|384|||384||||If you bring me your white stallion, I'll trade you for one from the new herd. The new horse will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it. You can look at the swift steeds here to see what it will look like. ~ MUST PAY 500 Gold too....",
[7678]="Palomino Exchange|1|12|60|384|||384||||",
[7701]="WANTED: Overseer Maltorius|50|51|45||179827||14634||||Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius. ~ Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",
[7703]="Unfinished Gordok Business|60|2557|56|14325|||14325||||Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul. ~ According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",
[7704]="Look at the Size of It!|50|51|45|||18950|14628||||Take Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow to Evonice Sootsmoker in the Searing Gorge.",
[7721]="Fuel for the Zapping|48|357|45|14637|||14637|||7726|Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",
[7723]="Curse These Fat Fingers|49|51|45|14627|||14627||||Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems. ~ The Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge.",
[7724]="Fiery Menace!|49|51|45|14627|||14627||||Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge. ~ Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.",
[7725]="Again With the Zapped Giants|55|357|45|14637|||14637||7003||Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 10 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",
[7726]="Refuel for the Zapping|55|357|45|14637|||14637||7721||Collect 6 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",
[7727]="Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It|49|51|45|14627|||14627||||Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Incendosaurs. ~ You will find Incendosaurs occupying the lava pools inside the Slag Pit. The Slag Pit can be found in the Cauldron of the Searing Gorge. ~ Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Incendosaurs.",
[7728]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass|48|51|45||179827||14626||||Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge. ~ The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts.",
[7730]="Zukk'ash Infestation|45|357|39|7875|||7875||2903||Bring 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",
[7731]="Stinglasher|47|357|39|7875|||7875||2903||Defeat Stinglasher in the Writhing Deep, bringing its glands back to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",
[7732]="Zukk'ash Report|48|357|39|7875|||7010||7730,7731||Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",
[7733]="Improved Quality|48|357|40|7852|||7852||2821||Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",
[7734]="Improved Quality|48|357|40|7854|||7854||2822||Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",
[7735]="Pristine Yeti Hide|48|357|40|||18969|7852||2821||Bring the Pristine Yeti Hide to Pratt McGrubben at the Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",
[7738]="Perfect Yeti Hide|48|357|40|||18972|7854||2822||Bring the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",
[7761]="Blackhand's Command|60|1583|55|||18987||179880|||That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command. ~ The letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate.",
[7781]="The Lord of Blackrock|60|1519|60|||19003|1748|||7782|Return the Head of Nefarian to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",
[7782]="The Lord of Blackrock|60|1519|60|1748|||14721||7781||Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",
[7783]="The Lord of Blackrock|60|1637|60|||19002|4949|||7784|Return the Head of Nefarian to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
[7784]="The Lord of Blackrock|60|1637|60|4949|||14720||7783||Speak with High Overlord Saurfang in Orgrimmar. He stands waiting for you in the Valley of Strength.",
[7785]="Examine the Vessel|60|-344|60|||19016|14347|||7786|Examine the Vessel of Rebirth and return it to Highlord Demitrian.",
[7786]="Thunderaan the Windseeker|60|-344|60|14347|||14347||7785|7787|To free Thunderaan the Windseeker from his prison, you must present the right and left halves of the Bindings of the Windseeker, 10 bars of Elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord to Highlord Demitrian in Silithus.",
[7787]="Rise, Thunderfury!|60|-344|60|||19018|14347||7786||Present the Dormant Wind Kissed Blade to Highlord Demitrian.",
[7810]="Arena Master|55|33|1|||18706|14508|||7838|Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena.",
[7815]="Snapjaws, Mon!|50|47|44|14740|||14740||||Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task.",
[7838]="Arena Grandmaster|55|33|1|14508|||14508||7810||",
[7840]="Lard Lost His Lunch|49|47|44|14731|||14731||||Lard at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Lard's Lunch. Return to him when this task is complete. ~ Lard mentioned that he left it on the island to the north. Watch out for Vilebranch trolls.",
[7841]="Message to the Wildhammer|48|47|44|14738|||14738|||7842|Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to slaughter 15 Highvale Outrunners, 15 Highvale Scouts, 15 Highvale Marksman and 15 Highvale Rangers. Return to him when this task is complete. ~ You can find the Highvale high elves at the Quel'Danil Lodge in the northwestern region of the Hinterlands.",
[7842]="Another Message to the Wildhammer|48|47|44|14738|||14738||7841|7843|Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to bring him 10 Long Elegant Feathers from the gryphons that inhabit the Hinterlands. Return to him once this task is complete. ~ Gryphons are known to inhabit every region of the Hinterlands.",
[7843]="The Final Message to the Wildhammer|50|47|44|14738|||14738||7842||Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to travel to Aerie Peak in the western region of the Hinterlands and place the Final Message to the Wildhammer by the well in the center of town. Return to him once this task is complete. ~ Beware of angry Wildhammer dwarves and unruly members of the Alliance.",
[7845]="Kidnapped Elder Torntusk!|51|47|46|14736|||14757|||7846|Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to rescue her mate, Elder Torntusk, from Jintha'alor. ~ You have been told that he is being held prisoner atop Jintha'alor, the Vilebranch capital city located in the southern region of the Hinterlands.",
[7846]="Recover the Key!|51|47|46|14757|||14757||7845|7847|Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to kill Hitah'ya the Keeper to get the Shackle Key to his bindings. Return to Elder Torntusk when you have recovered the key.",
[7847]="Return to Primal Torntusk|51|47|46|14757|||14736||7846||Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village with news of his rescue.",
[7849]="Separation Anxiety|50|47|46|14741|||14741||||Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor. ~ Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple.",
[7850]="Dark Vessels|50|47|46|14736|||14736||||Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 10 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete.",
[7861]="Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions|51|47|46||179913||14736||||You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete. ~ Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands.",
[7862]="Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village|51|47|46||179913||14736||||You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters. ~ Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",
