[8278]="Noggle's Last Hope|57|1377|54|15189|||15189||8277|8282|Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 3 Stonelash Pincer Stingers, 3 Stonelash Flayer Stingers and 3 Rock Stalker Fangs.",
